<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Wait for You - Demo</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Demo(s) About Love</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0HxPau27AYpct4FBQSysBS</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">4 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wait For You (Demo) Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Been meaning to tell you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What's on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I must've thought about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A thousand times</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, we've been talking for some time now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why don't we see what this could be about?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Mmm, I don't know</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Think it's time you should let</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let me see</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What this love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Could really be</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Give it time, you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby, you know I'll be waiting (Let it go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm goin' give you your time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You know that I'm always there</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To treat you right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You made me feel special through the</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Days and nights</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I thought that you'd be the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To hold me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I found out you've</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Been messing around[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now I see</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That you're not meant for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You should go</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go ahead and leave me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I gave you time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And you wasted mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So now what do I do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'd always wait for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I thought you'd be here too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'd always wait for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I thought you'd be here too</p></div></body></tt>